sequenceDiagram
  participant User as Merchant
  participant Grid as Shared grid
  participant Planner as Rust planner
  participant Model as Model provider
  participant API as Native API
  participant DB as Tenant database
  User->>Grid: Optional&#58; ask your list
  Grid->>Planner: Question, entity, locale
  Planner->>Planner: Current assistant / domain / PII rights
  Planner->>Model: Bounded question + allowlisted schema
  Model-->>Planner: Suggested criteria
  Planner->>Planner: Validate criteria&#59; no SQL or identity
  Planner-->>Grid: Read-only filter suggestion
  Grid-->>User: Review the filters
  User->>Grid: Explicit Apply
  Grid->>API: Native criteria + cursor read
  API->>API: Current membership, rights and tenant
  API->>DB: Parameter-bound query and global sort
  DB-->>API: Bounded permitted rows
  API-->>Grid: Authorized native response
